WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:02.268
KENDALL ROY:
<i> I'm better than you.</i>

00:00:02.601 --> 00:00:04.403
<i> You're corrupt. Evil.</i>

00:00:05.171 --> 00:00:08.074
LOGAN ROY:<i> Don't talk about
 things you don't understand.</i>

00:00:08.408 --> 00:00:11.678
<i> I know things about the world,
 or I wouldn't turn a buck.</i>

00:00:12.579 --> 00:00:13.779
Fuck off, kiddo.

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:16.249
Hey, I hear you tried
to kill Dad again, Fatty.

00:00:16.516 --> 00:00:18.818
<i> Do you have a fetish
 for nearly killing Dad?</i>

00:00:18.984 --> 00:00:21.487
Like "just the tip,"
