and his company.

00:00:33.533 --> 00:00:36.936
Or do you not actually give
a fuck, and it's all just ego?

00:00:37.369 --> 00:00:41.141
It's war.
I'm gonna jam a Montblanc
down his fuckin' throat.

00:00:41.707 --> 00:00:42.942
This is a PR disaster.

00:00:43.043 --> 00:00:45.010
<i> They could subpoena you
 to the grand jury.</i>

00:00:45.110 --> 00:00:46.111
<i> Everybody cooperates.</i>

00:00:46.178 --> 00:00:47.113
(CHANTING)

00:00:47.547 --> 00:00:49.848
TOM WAMBSGANS:<i> Logan is very
interested in what you're up to.</i>

00:00:50.316 --> 00:00:53.285
You better crawl into
a criminal's corpse and hide.

00:00:53.552 --> 00:00:55.021
(GULPS, CLEARS THROAT)

00:00:55.321 --> 00:00:56.955
Strong. Wow. Nice and strong--

00:00:56.989 --> 00:00:59.292
Strong one. Strong for a man.

00:00:59.359 --> 00:01:00.626
♪ (MUSIC CONTINUES) ♪

00:01:00.693 --> 00:01:01.794
KENDALL:<i> I'm takin' my dad down,</i>

00:01:01.861 --> 00:01:03.563
<i> and I'm not interested
 in any deals with him.</i>

00:01:03.963 --> 00:01:06.999
You work for the shareholders,
and I don't bet on blood feuds.

00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:10.203
LOGAN:
<i>I need to know where everyone is
