00:01:10.303 --> 00:01:12.471
ROMAN ROY:
<i>We're about to lose the company
 at the shareholder meet</i>

00:01:12.538 --> 00:01:14.741
'cause you tried
to assassinate our dad.

00:01:15.074 --> 00:01:18.311
Roman, stick with me. I'm an
incredibly dangerous enemy.

00:01:18.811 --> 00:01:21.914
Oh, don't threaten me, Gerri.
I don't have time to jerk off.

00:01:22.381 --> 00:01:24.016
