00:01:24.316 --> 00:01:25.151
Tell 'em to fuck off!

00:01:25.418 --> 00:01:27.353
Yeah, these are the ones
who don't fuck off.

00:01:27.687 --> 00:01:29.255
Can we ask 'em
to come back tomorrow?

00:01:29.322 --> 00:01:30.189
-Logan--
-Are you--

00:01:30.323 --> 00:01:31.924
