00:01:42.735 --> 00:01:44.837
You come for me. What have
you got in your fuckin' hand?

00:01:44.937 --> 00:01:47.673
You have no leverage.
I'm in control here.

00:01:48.173 --> 00:01:49.442
Listen to me very carefully.

00:01:49.542 --> 00:01:51.010
This is you throwing it away.

00:01:51.076 --> 00:01:52.912
-Everything I have fought
and bled for.
-Okay...

00:01:53.012 --> 00:01:55.915
-I am not gonna let that happen!
Do you understand me?!
-Not fucking--!

